"style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The socket may show features of infection or trauma", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "socket"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "show"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "features"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infection"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trauma"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1146"}}, {"id": "body-17236", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-17237", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Depending with the severity of bleeding, patient may need further investigations such as full blood picture, grouping and compatibility testing and coagulation parameters", "runs": [{"text": "Depending"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "severity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bleeding,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "need"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "further"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "investigations"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "such"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "full"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "picture,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "grouping"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and compatibility testing and coagulation parameters"}]}, {"id": "body-17239", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-17240", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If the patient is using anticoagulants, discuss with physician for decision to stop or adjust anticoagulants", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "using"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anticoagulants,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "discuss"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physician"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "decision"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stop"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adjust"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anticoagulants"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1146"}}, {"id": "body-17241", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Depending with the results of the investigations above, patient may be given blood transfusion", "runs": [{"text": "Depending"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "results"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "investigations"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "above,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "given"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "transfusion"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1146"}}, {"id": "body-17242", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Give local anesthesia (lidocaine 2% with epinephrine (adrenaline) 1 in 80,000 IU).", "runs": [{"text": "Give"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "local"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anesthesia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(lidocaine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "2%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "epinephrine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(adrenaline)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "80,000"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "IU)."}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1146"}}, {"id": "body-17243", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Clear any clot available and examine the socket to identify source of bleeding. Suturing of the wound only when necessary (like